{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/clax-antigravity/hooks.json","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-27T00:56:01.998669Z","id":"e372f20a41107cbb8ecc12a959bc2d5a071b9cfde4f36652ec6793f200491432","body":{"detail":"The hooks carry 5 s (PreInvocation, PostToolUse) and 10 s (Stop) timeouts. In the live runs on agy 1.5.18 (2026-11-26) every hook finished within 60 ms (duration_ms in hooks.log), so a hook killed at its timeout, and whether agy then drops its output, fails the turn or retries, was never seen (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-26-antigravity-plugin-design.md, section 12). A Stop hook killed after it took feedback would leave that feedback delivered but never shown.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":3},"end":{"line":13},"content_hash":"fd9da2c8d2bdae725fa2e423ec0b002370cf323ece6ca1465eb898a4cbf4ea2f"},"summary":"What Antigravity does when one of these hooks passes its timeout is unobserved","tags":["antigravity","unverified","session:claude-code:72db06c0-ac79-492e-a12b-1ce3a6c68c01"]}}
